向镜头，表情自然放松，不露齿，眼神正视前方。\n\n服装要求：完全复刻图2的服装样式、颜色、面料纹理及细节，衣领与颈部自然贴合，保证服装与人物颈部、肩膀比例和光影自然融合，保持服装的立体感和垂坠感。\n\n光线处理：专业影棚柔光箱布光，面部受光均匀，消除原图杂乱阴影，保留适度下颌阴影增强立体感，眼神光自然，肤色还原真实。\n\n背景设置：*背景，无杂物无纹理，符合证件照规范。\n\n构图标准：头顶预留画面高度10%的空白，裁切至胸部位置，头部位于画面上三分之一处，画面左右对称平衡，符合标准证件照比例。\n\n技术规格：85mm等效焦距，f/8光圈景深，高分辨率，照片级真实感。\n\n必须保留：个人独特面部特征、真实皮肤质感、原生发型细节、自然表情神态。\n严格禁止：磨皮过度、痘印、痘痘、五官变形、头部歪斜、肩膀高低不平、衣领穿帮、合成痕迹明显。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 39, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [473.6463928222656, 701.2722778320312], "pos": [2469.853759765625, 2534.01904296875], "widgets_values": ["Flux2-Klein"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 46, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "id": 40, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.8.2", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 29}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-1555.7221327460215, -1792.7521109263712], "scale": 0.620921323059155}}, "groups": [{"color": "#b06634", "font_size": 65, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "QQ交流群：1056408849", "bounding": [1154.85107421875, 492.64599609375, 755.5650024414062, 88.48194885253906]}, {"color": "#b06634", "font_size": 60, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "微信交流群", "bounding": [1140.8386230468